<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:26:16 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>泽伦斯基表示，如果特朗普谈判失败，国会应向俄罗斯施压</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/zelenskyy-congress-should-press-russia-if-talks-fail-video</link><description>弗拉基米尔·泽连斯基表示，如果特朗普总统未能在年底前达成和平协议，他将要求民主党控制的新国会向俄罗斯施加压力。亚历克斯·摩根从乌克兰总统接受彭博新闻社独家采访中获得了主要收获。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/zelenskyy-congress-should-press-russia-if-talks-fail-video'&gt;泽伦斯基表示，如果特朗普谈判失败，国会应向俄罗斯施压&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Zelenskyy Says Congress Should Pressure Russia if Trump Talks Fail&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/zelenskyy-congress-should-press-russia-if-talks-fail-video</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:51:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>霍尔木兹海峡管理局将拖船列入黑名单，加大油轮运输压力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iran-adds-tugs-to-hormuz-blacklist-as-pressure-on-shipping-grows</link><description>寻求控制霍尔木兹海峡交通的伊朗机构将拖船添加到其“不合规名单”中，这是德黑兰正在加大对支持油轮运输的生态系统的压力的最新迹象。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iran-adds-tugs-to-hormuz-blacklist-as-pressure-on-shipping-grows'&gt;霍尔木兹海峡管理局将拖船列入黑名单，加大油轮运输压力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hormuz Strait Authority Blacklists Tugboats, Raising Pressure on Tanker Traffic&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iran-adds-tugs-to-hormuz-blacklist-as-pressure-on-shipping-grows</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:54:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英伟达兴奋消退、新关税浮出水面，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</link><description>周二，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌，芯片制造商再次大幅下跌，科技股的缓解性反弹让位于对人工智能交易持久性的新担忧。美国新关税计划也打压股市，重新引发贸易担忧。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally'&gt;英伟达兴奋消退、新关税浮出水面，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Tumbles as Nvidia Euphoria Fades, New Tariffs Floated&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:45:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>调查发现，纽约市 21 岁以下的 Kalshi 用户损失了 890 万美元</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</link><description>根据 Kalshi 向纽约市议会发布的内部数据，纽约市有超过 50,000 名 18 岁至 21 岁之间的人在使用 Kalshi，他们正在以不成比例的速度亏损。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth'&gt;调查发现，纽约市 21 岁以下的 Kalshi 用户损失了 890 万美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Kalshi Users Under 21 Lost $8.9 Million in NYC, Probe Finds&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/nyc-calls-on-kalshi-polymarket-to-testify-on-marketing-to-youth</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:21:17 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</link><description>由于有关油轮进一步袭击的报道掩盖了解决美伊战争的最新外交努力，油价在假日交投清淡的情况下小幅走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24'&gt;11 月 24 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 24&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-24</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:04:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>伊拉克拒绝欧佩克+对其石油生产能力的评估</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iraq-rejects-opec-assessment-of-its-oil-production-capacity</link><description>据知情人士透露，伊拉克拒绝了欧佩克+委托对其石油产能进行的评估，这可能会在本周末的重要生产目标会议上发生冲突。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iraq-rejects-opec-assessment-of-its-oil-production-capacity'&gt;伊拉克拒绝欧佩克+对其石油生产能力的评估&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Iraq Rejects OPEC+ Assessment of Its Oil Production Capacity&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/iraq-rejects-opec-assessment-of-its-oil-production-capacity</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:04:34 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>土耳其释放因资金危机入狱18天的前部长</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days</link><description>土耳其前部长法特玛·贝图尔·萨扬·卡亚 (Fatma Betul Sayan Kaya) 在一次震动该国市场的投资基金调查中被捕，仅 18 天后就被释放出狱。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days'&gt;土耳其释放因资金危机入狱18天的前部长&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Turkey Frees Ex-Minister Jailed in Fund Crisis After 18 Days&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/turkey-frees-ex-minister-arrested-in-fund-scandal-after-18-days</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:40:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nvidia、Anthropic 遭受重创，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场休整</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>华尔街对人工智能交易的持久性再次产生怀疑，促使投资者转向更广泛的股票类别，同时提振债券。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;Nvidia、Anthropic 遭受重创，纳斯达克 100 指数下跌：市场休整&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Sinks as Nvidia, Anthropic Get Hammered: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-23/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:06:46 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>